<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:04.256" end="00:00:04.600" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.600" end="00:00:12.800" style="s2">Lord, please. April is only 18. Have mercy. Don&#39;t <br />hand her over to the orcs. I&#39;ll die in her place.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.800" end="00:00:26.500" style="s2">Hand over women and children. What the hell <br />is this? Wasn&#39;t I bed red in the hospital?</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.300" end="00:00:34.300" style="s2">Lord, are you still drunk? Last night, you went <br />mad and burned down the city&#39;s last granary,  </p>
<p begin="00:00:34.300" end="00:00:37.800" style="s2">the thousand pounds of grain we promised <br />[music] the orcs 3 days ago. Now,  </p>
<p begin="00:00:37.800" end="00:00:44.400" style="s2">we don&#39;t even have a single piece of bran. That <br />was your own order. If we can&#39;t deliver the grain,  </p>
<p begin="00:00:44.400" end="00:00:48.800" style="s2">we hand over these 50 women and children <br />as payment [music] to buy your own life.  </p>
<p begin="00:00:50.200" end="00:00:54.700" style="s2">I&#39;ve transmuted. I&#39;ve become a useless tyrant <br />who survives by selling women and children.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.900" end="00:01:04.300" style="s2">You trash in Yellow Earth City, listen <br />up. The sun is about to hit its peak.  </p>
<p begin="00:01:04.300" end="00:01:09.900" style="s2">Where&#39;s the,000 lb of grain? If you can&#39;t <br />deliver, I&#39;ll smash your gate right now.  </p>
<p begin="00:01:11.800" end="00:01:16.000" style="s2">Since I&#39;ve got a second chance at living healthy, <br />I&#39;m going to fix this mess. And as a modern man,  </p>
<p begin="00:01:16.000" end="00:01:19.600" style="s2">how can I stand by and watch these women and <br />[music] children be sent off as food? If I&#39;m  </p>
<p begin="00:01:19.600" end="00:01:24.800" style="s2">going to live, I&#39;m taking this whole city with <br />me. Standing tall. Preposterous. Release them all.  </p>
<p begin="00:01:25.400" end="00:01:31.600" style="s2">What trick [music] is he playing now? Detected <br />host online. Territory [music] defense  </p>
<p begin="00:01:31.600" end="00:01:35.583" style="s2">attributes on the verge of collapse. <br />Extreme material shortage. Lord Pale  </p>
<p begin="00:01:35.583" end="00:01:41.500" style="s2">level evolution system bondage path planned. <br />Current phase one agricultural sustainancy.  </p>
<p begin="00:01:41.500" end="00:01:46.000" style="s2">Grain? Is there not even a single edible grain <br />left in this tererry? [music] Go find me some.  </p>
<p begin="00:01:46.000" end="00:01:51.300" style="s2">Lord, the granary burned to ash long ago. Not even <br />grain. Even tree bark and grassroots have been  </p>
<p begin="00:01:51.300" end="00:01:56.200" style="s2">gnored clean. Current crisis imminent. [music] <br />Activating emergency beginner protection. Lord  </p>
<p begin="00:01:56.200" end="00:02:00.093" style="s2">must consume any substance containing <br />grain within 10 seconds upon successful  </p>
<p begin="00:02:00.093" end="00:02:05.493" style="s2">consumption. [music] Thousandfold manifestation <br />miracle will unlock. Has he gone mad? My lord.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.293" end="00:02:12.393" style="s2">Rough carbburst stick detected. <br />Consumption successful. Farming  </p>
<p begin="00:02:12.393" end="00:02:16.593" style="s2">attribute breaking limit. Thousandfold. <br />Manifestation. Lord. Lord&#39;s gone mad.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.493" end="00:02:38.493" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.493" end="00:02:43.593" style="s2">A miracle. [music] The gods haven&#39;t abandoned <br />us. Yellow Earth City is saved. What are you  </p>
<p begin="00:02:43.593" end="00:02:47.393" style="s2">all standing there for? [music] Quick, <br />fill saxs with a,000 2,000 lbs. Open  </p>
<p begin="00:02:47.393" end="00:02:50.493" style="s2">the gates immediately and deliver it to <br />the Orc army. If they accept the grain,  </p>
<p begin="00:02:50.493" end="00:02:58.493" style="s2">the whole city is saved. [groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.493" end="00:03:02.693" style="s2">Nobody [music] move. Not a single <br />grain of this food leaves the city.</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.193" end="00:03:15.193" style="s2">My lord, what are you saying? The orcs axes <br />have already splintered the outer gate. If  </p>
<p begin="00:03:15.193" end="00:03:18.893" style="s2">we don&#39;t deliver the grain, once the city <br />falls, we&#39;ll all be slaughtered for food.  </p>
<p begin="00:03:19.893" end="00:03:27.693" style="s2">I knew it. You madman. You never meant to save us. <br />You want to hoard this miracle for yourself. You  </p>
<p begin="00:03:27.693" end="00:03:35.493" style="s2">want to trade this mountain of grain for your <br />own wealth and glory. Don&#39;t you all see? As  </p>
<p begin="00:03:35.493" end="00:03:42.293" style="s2">long as he lives, we all die. Kill him. Kill <br />him and send the grain out, and we survive.</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.293" end="00:03:51.093" style="s2">Lord, [music] you forced us. If you won&#39;t <br />give us a way out, we all die together.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.093" end="00:04:04.594" style="s2">Send the grain out. You think those <br />beasts will retreat once they&#39;re fed?</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.294" end="00:04:12.494" style="s2">Today we send grain. Tomorrow they&#39;ll demand  </p>
<p begin="00:04:12.494" end="00:04:17.094" style="s2">our lives. Compromise only buys you a <br />bigger knife at your throat. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.194" end="00:04:25.894" style="s2">Listen clearly. This food is yours. It belongs <br />to every citizen of this territory. Eat. Eat  </p>
<p begin="00:04:25.894" end="00:04:29.994" style="s2">your bill. Only then will you have the strength <br />to grip your swords. As long as you stand on  </p>
<p begin="00:04:29.994" end="00:04:33.694" style="s2">this land. As long as you still trust me <br />as your lord, I will lead you to survive.  </p>
<p begin="00:04:33.694" end="00:04:41.894" style="s2">Mommy, sweet. It&#39;s real grain. I&#39;ll bear the sky <br />if it falls. I swear my life to you, my lord.  </p>
<p begin="00:04:41.894" end="00:04:47.194" style="s2">Territory cohesion significantly increased. <br />Unity plus one. Citizen [music] trust initiated.  </p>
<p begin="00:04:47.194" end="00:04:52.094" style="s2">Warning. Territory defense severely lacking. <br />Enemy military strength overwhelmingly superior.  </p>
<p begin="00:04:53.794" end="00:04:57.994" style="s2">Most critical shortage. [music] Iron. Host must <br />consume iron containing substance within 12 hours  </p>
<p begin="00:04:57.994" end="00:05:01.894" style="s2">to unlock defensive manifestation. Critical <br />warning. Host currently mortal [music] flesh.  </p>
<p begin="00:05:01.894" end="00:05:06.994" style="s2">Cannot withstand pure metal ingestion. Risk of <br />internal perforation. Eat iron. Are you serious?  </p>
<p begin="00:05:06.994" end="00:05:10.894" style="s2">Seek [music] edible alternative immediately. I <br />just finished my big speech and now you want me  </p>
<p begin="00:05:10.894" end="00:05:16.094" style="s2">to eat metal and [music] not pure metal. Where <br />the hell am I supposed to find edible iron?</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.694" end="00:05:24.994" style="s2">Crash of Yellow Earth City. <br />Time&#39;s up. Since you want to die,  </p>
<p begin="00:05:24.994" end="00:05:32.694" style="s2">I&#39;ll grant your wish. [screaming] All troops, <br />flatten the walls. Leave no one alive.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.494" end="00:05:44.494" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.494" end="00:05:50.594" style="s2">Lord, the orcs are about to attack. What? What <br />do we do? Panic. [music] Let me ask you, how many  </p>
<p begin="00:05:50.594" end="00:05:55.394" style="s2">usable weapons are left in the armory? Reporting, <br />my lord. Just counted. Besides the old knight&#39;s  </p>
<p begin="00:05:55.394" end="00:05:58.994" style="s2">broken sword, the entire city has only 10 wooden <br />swords and three rusted iron swords. 10 wooden  </p>
<p begin="00:05:58.994" end="00:06:03.794" style="s2">swords? Three rusted blades? You want me to gnaw <br />those 2 m tall orphs with my teeth? Iron. Where  </p>
<p begin="00:06:03.794" end="00:06:07.395" style="s2">else in the territory is there iron? Even iron <br />rich plants, rocks, anything. Go find it now.  </p>
<p begin="00:06:08.396" end="00:06:10.696" style="s2">It&#39;s over. Our lord has lost <br />his mind again. I know where.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.596" end="00:06:19.396" style="s2">This is iron moss. [music] Grows in the deepest <br />shade at the base of the city wall. It feeds  </p>
<p begin="00:06:19.396" end="00:06:26.796" style="s2">on underground mineral veins. It&#39;s full of iron. <br />[music] My lord, you can&#39;t. Absolutely not. This  </p>
<p begin="00:06:26.796" end="00:06:31.496" style="s2">iron moss will perforate your brows. This woman <br />is trying to poison you. Even if I have to die,  </p>
<p begin="00:06:31.496" end="00:06:38.896" style="s2">I should die before you. You You actually <br />ate it, madman. You really are a madman.  </p>
<p begin="00:06:39.496" end="00:06:45.696" style="s2">Warning. Toxin overload. Host internal organs <br />rapidly failing. Life critical. Stop the damn  </p>
<p begin="00:06:45.696" end="00:06:52.496" style="s2">chatter. Upgrade my defense. Ding. Emergency <br />protocol activated. Forcibly extracting toxin.  </p>
<p begin="00:06:52.496" end="00:06:57.596" style="s2">Converting to territory upgrade energy. [music] <br />Simultaneously activating defensive manifestation.</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.996" end="00:07:11.896" style="s2">The wall. The wall is growing.</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.496" end="00:07:27.896" style="s2">Trickery. A lowly human trick. You think a <br />layer of iron can stop the great orc horde? Wolf  </p>
<p begin="00:07:27.896" end="00:07:35.696" style="s2">cavalry. Build a human ladder. Nos it open if you <br />have to. My lord, be careful. They&#39;re coming up.  </p>
<p begin="00:07:35.696" end="00:07:40.696" style="s2">Before I got sick, I was an architect who <br />designed hundredstory skyscrapers. Trying  </p>
<p begin="00:07:40.696" end="00:07:46.096" style="s2">this on me? You&#39;re dead. Allison, light the <br />fire. Keep the iron plates on the wall. Redot.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.496" end="00:07:56.846" style="s2">Black steel is an excellent conductor <br />[music] of heat. Try climbing a red  </p>
<p begin="00:07:56.846" end="00:08:00.696" style="s2">hot iron pot with your bare hands. <br />Physics will teach you [music] a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.896" end="00:08:11.097" style="s2">It&#39;s hot. The wall is scorching. <br />[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.097" end="00:08:13.297" style="s2">Welcome to Freefall. Drop it on them.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.297" end="00:08:31.197" style="s2">[screaming and groaning] A</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.197" end="00:08:36.197" style="s2">tricks. You lowly, magicless humans. All <br />you&#39;re good for is these barbaric tricks  </p>
<p begin="00:08:36.197" end="00:08:41.097" style="s2">with hot iron. But what does it matter? This <br />world [music] belongs to magic. No matter how  </p>
<p begin="00:08:41.097" end="00:08:48.797" style="s2">many tricks you know, you have zero magical <br />defense. This iron can perfect as an oven for  </p>
<p begin="00:08:48.797" end="00:08:55.197" style="s2">yourselves. 3 days from now, I&#39;ll return <br />with the blazing flame beast Chimera. Its  </p>
<p begin="00:08:55.197" end="00:09:01.797" style="s2">highgrade magical acid will melt this wall <br />and all your tricks into a pool of blood.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.197" end="00:09:12.197" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong? The enemy [music] retreated. Why <br />do you all look like you&#39;ve lost your souls?  </p>
<p begin="00:09:12.797" end="00:09:19.997" style="s2">My lord, didn&#39;t you hear what Bal said? <br />Chimera, that&#39;s a high tier magical beast.  </p>
<p begin="00:09:20.897" end="00:09:25.897" style="s2">Don&#39;t you understand yet? This is a world where <br />magical power determines everything. What we  </p>
<p begin="00:09:25.897" end="00:09:32.097" style="s2">see as impenetrable defense is as fragile as a <br />candle before magic. It will melt in an instant.  </p>
<p begin="00:09:32.097" end="00:09:36.697" style="s2">Compared to orcs who are born with magic and high <br />tier magical beasts, we humans can&#39;t even defend  </p>
<p begin="00:09:36.697" end="00:09:42.597" style="s2">ourselves. In the eyes of all races, we are the <br />cheapest consumables. Since ordinary defense won&#39;t  </p>
<p begin="00:09:42.597" end="00:09:48.197" style="s2">work, [music] how do we stop a magical beast? <br />Fire. High tier magical beasts are instinctively  </p>
<p begin="00:09:48.197" end="00:09:53.697" style="s2">terror of magical flames. To survive, we must <br />build the legendary great furnace at the center  </p>
<p begin="00:09:53.697" end="00:09:59.197" style="s2">of the city. But the great furnace requires <br />high tier natural magic rays to be inscribed.  </p>
<p begin="00:09:59.197" end="00:10:03.697" style="s2">Across the entire continent, only the elves who <br />are born with magical interity can craft it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.997" end="00:10:15.198" style="s2">Lord Liam of Yellow Earth City, did I hear <br />that right? Orcs are attacking you with a  </p>
<p begin="00:10:15.198" end="00:10:19.398" style="s2">blazing flame beast, and you&#39;re asking us <br />noble elves to make you a great furnace.  </p>
<p begin="00:10:20.398" end="00:10:24.998" style="s2">Name your price. [music] If you send <br />craftsmen to build the great furnace,  </p>
<p begin="00:10:24.998" end="00:10:30.298" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay you a 100,000 gold coins after the battle <br />or 10 years of mining rights from the territory.  </p>
<p begin="00:10:31.898" end="00:10:39.398" style="s2">100,000 gold. You short-lived human consumables <br />don&#39;t deserve to use Elian magical creations.  </p>
<p begin="00:10:40.098" end="00:10:44.898" style="s2">Waste Elian time on a godforsakened mudpit. <br />After you&#39;re melted into blood by the beast,  </p>
<p begin="00:10:44.898" end="00:10:51.398" style="s2">we&#39;ll come collect the unclaimed mines. Keep <br />your [music] gold. Buy yourself a decent coffin.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.298" end="00:11:04.898" style="s2">No one will help us. The arrogant elves won&#39;t, and <br />neither will the Empire. In their eyes, we aren&#39;t  </p>
<p begin="00:11:04.898" end="00:11:11.398" style="s2">even human. High and mighty elves, huh? Technology <br />monopoly, huh? I hated that in the modern world.  </p>
<p begin="00:11:11.398" end="00:11:18.198" style="s2">[music] System. If the elves won&#39;t come, can I <br />defend this city? Calculation complete. Current  </p>
<p begin="00:11:18.198" end="00:11:26.198" style="s2">territory magic resistance 0 point. Survival rate <br />against blazing [music] flame beast siege 0.001%.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.998" end="00:11:32.898" style="s2">Cut the crap. Tell me the solution. <br />How do I get the great furnace?  </p>
<p begin="00:11:34.598" end="00:11:38.998" style="s2">Search complete. Only option. [music] <br />Post must consume the complete blueprints  </p>
<p begin="00:11:38.998" end="00:11:43.098" style="s2">of the great furnace natural fire <br />system. [music] Upon consumption,  </p>
<p begin="00:11:43.098" end="00:11:47.398" style="s2">all manufacturing processes and magic ray and <br />script techniques [music] will be unlocked.  </p>
<p begin="00:11:48.298" end="00:11:53.498" style="s2">My lord, perhaps I should take the remaining <br />soldiers and escort [music] you out under cover  </p>
<p begin="00:11:53.498" end="00:12:02.898" style="s2">of night. Better to keep the flame alive. No need <br />to break out. We steal [music] it. Steal what?  </p>
<p begin="00:12:03.798" end="00:12:11.498" style="s2">The elven great furnace blueprints. Just [music] <br />wait. Once I learn how to build great furnaces,  </p>
<p begin="00:12:11.498" end="00:12:16.299" style="s2">I&#39;ll build one for free for every suffering <br />city. Let&#39;s see how smug those elves stay.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.900" end="00:12:32.200" style="s2">My lord, are you really going into <br />the Elve lands alone? That&#39;s far too  </p>
<p begin="00:12:32.200" end="00:12:36.800" style="s2">dangerous. Staying in the city and waiting to <br />die is even more [music] dangerous. Ellison,  </p>
<p begin="00:12:37.700" end="00:12:40.900" style="s2">watch over the stronghold. I&#39;ll <br />be back with the blueprints.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.700" end="00:12:49.700" style="s2">Take me with you. Don&#39;t be ridiculous. <br />I&#39;m going in to steal something. Not on  </p>
<p begin="00:12:49.700" end="00:12:57.500" style="s2">a pleasure trip. [music] Ridiculous? You, a <br />pampered lord who doesn&#39;t even know the roads  </p>
<p begin="00:12:57.500" end="00:13:00.700" style="s2">3 miles outside the city. Do you even <br />know how many kinds of poisonous vines  </p>
<p begin="00:13:00.700" end="00:13:04.600" style="s2">grow in the Mistwood? You can&#39;t even <br />tell poison vines from ordinary ones.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.100" end="00:13:16.200" style="s2">I grew up gathering herbs on the border <br />with my father. I know every [music] path  </p>
<p begin="00:13:16.200" end="00:13:19.800" style="s2">in that forest. Without me, you won&#39;t <br />even make it through the outer woods,  </p>
<p begin="00:13:19.800" end="00:13:21.600" style="s2">let alone steal [music] <br />the great forge blueprints.  </p>
<p begin="00:13:23.600" end="00:13:27.700" style="s2">You&#39;re right. I [snorts] really can&#39;t tell vines <br />apart. I&#39;ll be counting on you to lead the way.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.900" end="00:13:35.200" style="s2">Let&#39;s go. We have to move fast if <br />we want to save Yellow Earth City.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.100" end="00:13:43.100" style="s2">I hope we don&#39;t both end up dead because of this.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.300" end="00:13:56.500" style="s2">Strange. The fog&#39;s too <br />thick. I&#39;ve lost my bearings.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.100" end="00:14:03.800" style="s2">Look at the direction the moss [music] is <br />growing. The exit should be to the northwest.  </p>
<p begin="00:14:03.800" end="00:14:07.600" style="s2">How do you know this? Nobles never <br />learn wilderness survival skills.  </p>
<p begin="00:14:07.600" end="00:14:12.400" style="s2">Read more. Think more. Knowledge is <br />the foundation of survival anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.701" end="00:14:20.701" style="s2">[music]  </p>
<p begin="00:14:20.701" end="00:14:23.101" style="s2">You seem different from before.  </p>
<p begin="00:14:23.701" end="00:14:28.001" style="s2">That was then. Now, I&#39;m going to lead <br />[music] everyone through this alive.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.601" end="00:14:49.601" style="s2">That  </p>
<p begin="00:14:49.601" end="00:14:53.001" style="s2">That was an elven detection ward. If that blue <br />light had hit us, the patrols would have caught  </p>
<p begin="00:14:53.001" end="00:14:57.101" style="s2">us for sure. You bit my finger just now. <br />You just grabbed me out of nowhere. I&#39;m  </p>
<p begin="00:14:57.101" end="00:15:00.901" style="s2">sorry I didn&#39;t react in time. The detection <br />ward has gaps. Stay right in my footsteps.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.801" end="00:15:15.601" style="s2">That&#39;s it. Lord Silus estate. The great <br />forge blueprint should be in his library.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.601" end="00:15:25.601" style="s2">Damn. Two hell hounds at the gate. This is <br />silence herb. Grind it up and rub it on your  </p>
<p begin="00:15:25.601" end="00:15:29.801" style="s2">skin. The hounds won&#39;t catch our scent. But I only <br />gathered enough for one person. No, that&#39;s plenty.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.401" end="00:15:44.701" style="s2">Liam, how can you even do that? Coach yourself <br />in it. We&#39;ll climb in from the sidewall.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.101" end="00:16:04.401" style="s2">It actually worked. Good thing I brought you <br />along. Of course, I didn&#39;t come here to be  </p>
<p begin="00:16:04.401" end="00:16:14.401" style="s2">dead. Wait. At this hour, Silus is still receiving <br />guests. What? An elf lord in talks with an orc.</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.503" end="00:16:29.003" style="s2">What is this? Arrogant elves dealing with orcs? <br />Nobility is [music] just a mask. Underneath  </p>
<p begin="00:16:29.003" end="00:16:36.403" style="s2">it&#39;s all dirty deals. Bal is an idiot driven <br />back by humans with hot iron. My lord, Chief  </p>
<p begin="00:16:36.403" end="00:16:41.603" style="s2">Bal has already gathered the beasts. In 2 days, <br />Yellow Earth City will be painted red with blood.</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.603" end="00:16:50.003" style="s2">Once the city falls, leave <br />no survivors. After that,  </p>
<p begin="00:16:50.003" end="00:16:56.403" style="s2">the mines beneath the city are yours. I only want <br />what we agreed on. Understood. We won&#39;t fail.  </p>
<p begin="00:16:56.403" end="00:17:01.103" style="s2">They&#39;re going to kill everyone in the city. <br />Stay calm, Avil. Don&#39;t make a sound. Sillus  </p>
<p begin="00:17:01.103" end="00:17:07.503" style="s2">would ally with orcs just to take Yellow <br />Earth City. What is he really after? Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.603" end="00:17:22.603" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.603" end="00:17:23.503" style="s2">Damn straight cat.  </p>
<p begin="00:17:25.703" end="00:17:34.603" style="s2">All right, we&#39;re clear. Why is your face so <br />red? Are you hurt? No, you just pulled my hair.</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.503" end="00:17:42.303" style="s2">[music] Ail, we have to get those blueprints now.  </p>
<p begin="00:17:42.302" end="00:17:46.702" style="s2">M I memorized the estate layout. The library <br />is right next door. I I&#39;ll lead the way.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.802" end="00:18:02.302" style="s2">Look that box. It&#39;s carved <br />with the great forge seal.  </p>
<p begin="00:18:04.603" end="00:18:10.703" style="s2">Detected a magic construction blueprint. The <br />great forge and one high purity fire crystal.  </p>
<p begin="00:18:10.703" end="00:18:16.703" style="s2">Not just the blueprint, a fire crystal, <br />too. A bonus. Liam, watch out. Guards.</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.204" end="00:18:38.704" style="s2">Who&#39;s there? They&#39;re heading that way after them.  </p>
<p begin="00:18:39.304" end="00:18:42.104" style="s2">Now, while they&#39;re gone, we head <br />back to Yellow Earth City tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.304" end="00:18:54.404" style="s2">People of Yellow Earth, I&#39;ve brought back <br />the Great Forge blueprints. With this,  </p>
<p begin="00:18:54.404" end="00:18:57.304" style="s2">we can forge fire and drive back the Kyrus.  </p>
<p begin="00:18:58.304" end="00:19:03.804" style="s2">Are those actually the Great forge plans? Even <br />if they are, we can&#39;t read Elvin scripe. How  </p>
<p begin="00:19:03.804" end="00:19:09.304" style="s2">are we supposed to build it? Trust me. I <br />say it can be done [music] and it will be</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.604" end="00:19:17.704" style="s2">everyone. I saw with my [music] own eyes what our  </p>
<p begin="00:19:17.704" end="00:19:20.804" style="s2">lord risked for us. I believe <br />he can lead us through this.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.704" end="00:19:29.804" style="s2">In two days, the great forge will stand <br />in the heart of yellow earth city.  </p>
<p begin="00:19:31.404" end="00:19:38.304" style="s2">Detected magic construction blueprint. The Great <br />Forge. Swallow it to begin analysis. If I swallow  </p>
<p begin="00:19:38.304" end="00:19:43.004" style="s2">this blueprint, forge the great forge, then <br />we can defeat the Chimera, crush the Orc army.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.004" end="00:19:54.804" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.804" end="00:20:06.604" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.604" end="00:20:12.804" style="s2">Did it work? Great for structure <br />analysis complete. Stored in Lord  </p>
<p begin="00:20:12.804" end="00:20:16.604" style="s2">database. Construction may begin <br />once materials are gathered.  </p>
<p begin="00:20:18.004" end="00:20:21.905" style="s2">Even with the thousandfold return, <br />I still need tons of iron and coal.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.405" end="00:20:35.105" style="s2">My lord, are you well?  </p>
<p begin="00:20:35.905" end="00:20:40.705" style="s2">Ellison, take every coin from the treasury and <br />buy iron and coal from nearby territories. As  </p>
<p begin="00:20:40.705" end="00:20:47.805" style="s2">much as you can get, my lord, there are only 30 <br />silver coins [music] left. It won&#39;t buy much.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.305" end="00:20:56.505" style="s2">Porn this, too. [music] We must have the materials <br />by sunset. My lord, this sword was passed down  </p>
<p begin="00:20:56.505" end="00:21:01.405" style="s2">from the former lord. You can&#39;t. What use is a <br />blade when we&#39;re all dead? Do it now. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.105" end="00:21:11.505" style="s2">This is all I&#39;ve saved. It&#39;s <br />not much, but I want to help.  </p>
<p begin="00:21:11.505" end="00:21:14.405" style="s2">The lord is pointing his own <br />sword. Why are we holding back?</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.605" end="00:21:24.605" style="s2">[music]  </p>
<p begin="00:21:24.605" end="00:21:30.105" style="s2">Everyone, as long as Yellow Earth <br />stands, I will repay you 10fold.</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.905" end="00:21:45.405" style="s2">Great [music] forges materials ready. Begin <br />manifestation. System, begin manifestation.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.405" end="00:21:56.317" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.317" end="00:22:11.905" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.905" end="00:22:16.005" style="s2">My lord, the orc army is here. They have the <br />chimera with them. They&#39;re only 10 miles out.</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.905" end="00:22:32.306" style="s2">My lord, the camir moves fast. At this pace, it <br />will be at our gates within half an hour. My lord,  </p>
<p begin="00:22:32.307" end="00:22:37.907" style="s2">why isn&#39;t the forge responding? [sighs] That can&#39;t <br />be right. The system constructed forge should  </p>
<p begin="00:22:37.907" end="00:22:45.507" style="s2">be flawless. System. Why won&#39;t the great forge <br />activate? The Great Forge requires a fire element  </p>
<p begin="00:22:45.507" end="00:22:49.807" style="s2">magic array to channel the core fire crystal&#39;s <br />power. Host&#39;s current mana level is zero.  </p>
<p begin="00:22:51.307" end="00:22:55.207" style="s2">Damn it. Of all times, where <br />are we supposed to get mana?</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.207" end="00:23:04.807" style="s2">Nice iron shell you&#39;ve built. <br />But you manless insects have  </p>
<p begin="00:23:04.807" end="00:23:09.107" style="s2">no idea [music] what you&#39;re up <br />against. Kimra, melt that wall.</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.107" end="00:23:25.907" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.907" end="00:23:30.107" style="s2">Liam, what are you doing? Humans have <br />no mana, but the fire crystal does.  </p>
<p begin="00:23:30.107" end="00:23:34.707" style="s2">You&#39;re going to swallow it? That&#39;s pure fire <br />element mana crystal. It will burn you alive.  </p>
<p begin="00:23:34.707" end="00:23:38.907" style="s2">If the system can convert toxic moss, <br />then I can swallow this crystal, too.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.207" end="00:23:51.907" style="s2">Damn. Warning. Post internal <br />fire element mana concentration  </p>
<p begin="00:23:51.907" end="00:23:56.707" style="s2">exceeds limits. Body tissue is burning. <br />Initiating emergency conversion. Burn.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.907" end="00:24:11.307" style="s2">Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.307" end="00:24:15.407" style="s2">How could lowly humans <br />command the elves great forge?</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.008" end="00:24:39.008" style="s2">My lord, the firewall blocks the Chimera&#39;s <br />venom, but our arrows can&#39;t penetrate its shield.  </p>
<p begin="00:24:39.608" end="00:24:44.808" style="s2">The firewall can only defend. We need a way to <br />attack. If the Great Forge&#39;s [music] firewall  </p>
<p begin="00:24:44.808" end="00:24:49.108" style="s2">counters the Camir&#39;s acid, then bolts forged <br />from it should pierce its shield, too.  </p>
<p begin="00:24:50.508" end="00:24:57.008" style="s2">John, throw all scrap iron into the <br />secondary furnace. All of it quickly.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.808" end="00:25:18.708" style="s2">Adjust the ruden circuit. Channel the <br />Fire Crystal&#39;s mana into the secondary  </p>
<p begin="00:25:18.708" end="00:25:23.608" style="s2">furnace and accelerate the smelting. <br />Liam, don&#39;t push yourself too hard.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.408" end="00:25:45.908" style="s2">These carry fire element mana, my <br />lord. How did you do this? Ellison,  </p>
<p begin="00:25:45.908" end="00:25:52.008" style="s2">take all the archers. Use these arrows to pierce <br />that Kamir. Archers, follow me. Ready to fire.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.308" end="00:25:58.508" style="s2">Fire.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.508" end="00:26:08.802" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.802" end="00:26:23.508" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.508" end="00:26:29.208" style="s2">My lord, the [music] beast mana is spent. We&#39;ve <br />done it. Don&#39;t give it a chance to recover.  </p>
<p begin="00:26:29.808" end="00:26:35.809" style="s2">Counterattack [music] immediately. The fire <br />mana is still ravaging my body. Damn, it hurts.  </p>
<p begin="00:26:37.209" end="00:26:40.509" style="s2">Liam, hold on. [music] Leave the rest to Ellison.</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.709" end="00:26:45.709" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.709" end="00:26:51.109" style="s2">Cavalry, follow me out of <br />the gates. Take their heads.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.509" end="00:27:15.309" style="s2">Damn humans. Retreat. Retreat <br />now. Filthy orcs. Die.</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.009" end="00:27:50.009" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.009" end="00:27:58.909" style="s2">My lord, mission accomplished. Liam, you did <br />it. You really saved everyone. Yeah, we won.  </p>
<p begin="00:27:59.709" end="00:28:05.309" style="s2">Territorial threat cleared. Prosperity threshold <br />[music] met. Upgrade granted. Reward fertility  </p>
<p begin="00:28:05.309" end="00:28:11.909" style="s2">soil art. This is just the [music] beginning. We <br />broke Silus&#39;s scheme. He won&#39;t let it slide. Hint:  </p>
<p begin="00:28:11.909" end="00:28:15.309" style="s2">neighboring citystates Ironwood and Breeze <br />Valley are suffering [music] under Elven  </p>
<p begin="00:28:15.309" end="00:28:22.709" style="s2">exploitation. Both are at the brink of collapse. <br />Expansion is advised. Ironwood and Breeze Valley.</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.909" end="00:28:33.609" style="s2">Yellow Earth City&#39;s immediate crisis is over. <br />But we can&#39;t stop here. These two city states  </p>
<p begin="00:28:33.609" end="00:28:37.110" style="s2">are the closest to us. [music] We need to <br />find a way to bring them into our territory.  </p>
<p begin="00:28:37.711" end="00:28:42.811" style="s2">My lord, Ironwood and Breeze Valley <br />may be human territories, but they&#39;ve  </p>
<p begin="00:28:42.811" end="00:28:48.411" style="s2">long been under elven control. If we attack, <br />[music] we risk provoking elven retaliation.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.411" end="00:28:55.211" style="s2">Who said anything about attacking? We&#39;re <br />going to form a federation with them.  </p>
<p begin="00:28:55.811" end="00:29:00.011" style="s2">The great forge technology we took from <br />the elves, that&#39;s our bargaining chip.  </p>
<p begin="00:29:01.911" end="00:29:06.711" style="s2">But Silas is watching from the sidelines. Will <br />he really just sit back [music] and let us grow?  </p>
<p begin="00:29:06.711" end="00:29:11.611" style="s2">Move fast. Before Silus can react, we&#39;ll have <br />turned all the pieces on the board to our color.  </p>
<p begin="00:29:13.111" end="00:29:17.011" style="s2">If my lord has decided, this old <br />knight will follow to the death.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.211" end="00:29:26.011" style="s2">Ellison, take a squad to Breeze Valley. <br />Bring the Great Furnace blueprints.  </p>
<p begin="00:29:26.511" end="00:29:29.511" style="s2">Understood. I&#39;ll prepare to depart at once.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.511" end="00:29:46.911" style="s2">Avil, you&#39;re with me. We&#39;re going <br />to Ironwood to meet their lord,</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.911" end="00:29:57.111" style="s2">the useless lord of yellow <br />earth to step onto my land.  </p>
<p begin="00:29:58.211" end="00:30:02.011" style="s2">Lord Vance, I came here to <br />offer Ironwood a way to survive.  </p>
<p begin="00:30:04.411" end="00:30:11.311" style="s2">A way out. You&#39;ve offended Lord [music] Silas, and <br />you want to drag us down with you? We can&#39;t bear  </p>
<p begin="00:30:11.311" end="00:30:18.811" style="s2">Silus&#39;s wraith. Ally with you is suicide. Silus <br />treats [music] us like slaves. Are you content to  </p>
<p begin="00:30:18.811" end="00:30:27.711" style="s2">keep growling at his feet? Shut up. Before magic, <br />we humans are nothing but grains of sand. Sand can  </p>
<p begin="00:30:27.711" end="00:30:36.211" style="s2">still grow grain. But cowards only know hunger. <br />Humans have no manner. Arrogant fools like you  </p>
<p begin="00:30:36.211" end="00:30:41.912" style="s2">will be torn apart by elven magic. Come out with <br />me. I&#39;ll show you why I can stand against Silus.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.912" end="00:30:56.712" style="s2">Nothing grows here, not even weeds. <br />What are you trying to show me?  </p>
<p begin="00:30:57.412" end="00:31:00.912" style="s2">Another year of failed harvest. We&#39;ll starve soon,</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.712" end="00:31:09.412" style="s2">Liam. My patience is wearing <br />thin. Stop playing tricks.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.012" end="00:31:23.012" style="s2">Open your eyes. This is what I&#39;m offering. <br />Ironwood system. Release fertility soil art.</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.879" end="00:31:40.012" style="s2">All show. If this dead land [music] <br />grows wheat, I&#39;ll eat the mud.</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.512" end="00:31:52.412" style="s2">What a miracle. We&#39;re saved.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.012" end="00:32:06.412" style="s2">Impossible. Humans have no manner. How <br />can you cast highlevel earth magic?</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.012" end="00:32:14.212" style="s2">I told you I came to offer a [music] <br />way out. Do you believe me now?</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.312" end="00:32:22.612" style="s2">Ironwood submits [music] to you. <br />We will follow your command.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.713" end="00:32:46.713" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.713" end="00:32:48.313" style="s2">The real war is only beginning.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.813" end="00:33:01.413" style="s2">What&#39;s the meaning of this? Any <br />word from the orcs? My lord,  </p>
<p begin="00:33:02.413" end="00:33:06.713" style="s2">Bal is dead. Yellow earth has built the <br />great forge and defeated the chimea.</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.513" end="00:33:19.013" style="s2">Is that so? Not only did the orc army fall, <br />Ironwood and Breeze Valley [music] are also  </p>
<p begin="00:33:19.013" end="00:33:24.613" style="s2">declaring alliance with Yellow Earth. Liam <br />thinks stepping [music] out of yellow earth  </p>
<p begin="00:33:24.613" end="00:33:29.413" style="s2">is expanding his territory. In truth, he&#39;s just <br />stretching his neck out further for the blade.  </p>
<p begin="00:33:31.013" end="00:33:34.113" style="s2">My lord, shouldn&#39;t we send <br />troops to stop their alliance?  </p>
<p begin="00:33:35.513" end="00:33:39.613" style="s2">Humans need grain. Let&#39;s see how <br />they form an alliance without fields.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.013" end="00:33:49.013" style="s2">Deliver this to the orc [music] <br />remnants. Tell them to take their  </p>
<p begin="00:33:49.013" end="00:33:52.213" style="s2">wyven riders. Burn every field first, then <br />concentrate fire on Yellow Earth City.</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.313" end="00:33:59.213" style="s2">Liam, [music] you think you can win? This world <br />has always belonged to those who hold power.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.713" end="00:34:11.513" style="s2">What&#39;s that sound?</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.713" end="00:34:32.713" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.713" end="00:34:35.213" style="s2">Fire. [screaming] Save the wheat. Upgrade.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.515" end="00:34:47.815" style="s2">They&#39;re orc weapon riders. <br />We can&#39;t even touch them.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.615" end="00:35:07.615" style="s2">How could this happen? This was <br />all our hard work. Our food gone.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.215" end="00:35:17.815" style="s2">We can survive without grain. The <br />thousandfold [music] return system  </p>
<p begin="00:35:17.815" end="00:35:22.215" style="s2">can carry us. But my people&#39;s <br />safety. That I must guarantee.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.515" end="00:35:51.515" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.515" end="00:35:53.815" style="s2">Liam, what are you doing? That&#39;s a waver&#39;s scale.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.315" end="00:36:05.315" style="s2">No, Liam, spit it out. Stay back. I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.015" end="00:36:13.315" style="s2">system. Devour it.  </p>
<p begin="00:36:14.615" end="00:36:21.315" style="s2">Wyvern scale detected. Post esophagus damaged. <br />HP dropping. Initiating emergency repair.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.315" end="00:36:41.415" style="s2">These these are [music] wiver scales. So many</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.916" end="00:36:54.116" style="s2">Liam, are you all right?</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.616" end="00:37:07.216" style="s2">I&#39;m fine. Avil, take these scales back to Yellow <br />Earth. have the Smith&#39;s craft flight wings.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.516" end="00:37:15.116" style="s2">Thanks to him, we&#39;re about to <br />have an air force like no other.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.716" end="00:37:29.716" style="s2">The storehouse is overflowing. At this rate, <br />even if the orcs surround Yellow Earth again,  </p>
<p begin="00:37:29.716" end="00:37:35.316" style="s2">we can hold out for at least [music] 3 months. <br />Not enough. Burning the fields was only Silus&#39;s  </p>
<p begin="00:37:35.316" end="00:37:39.816" style="s2">first move. They&#39;ll be back. Grain alone won&#39;t win <br />a war. We need to strengthen [music] our military.</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.216" end="00:37:50.716" style="s2">My lord, the dragon scale [music] flight <br />wings are finished exactly as you designed.</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.716" end="00:38:03.816" style="s2">With these, can we [music] really fly like wyvens? <br />Of course. and more maneuverably than any Wyvern.</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.116" end="00:38:26.316" style="s2">Excellent. [music] These air <br />cavalry will become our trump card.</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.016" end="00:38:41.116" style="s2">The wider the legion. They&#39;re back <br />and there are more of them this time.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.716" end="00:38:52.417" style="s2">Pathetic humans. Scream as you burn. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.217" end="00:39:06.417" style="s2">My lord, air cavalry ready for deployment.  </p>
<p begin="00:39:06.417" end="00:39:09.117" style="s2">Break their formation. Don&#39;t let <br />them get [music] close to the city.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.617" end="00:39:15.217" style="s2">For the glory of yellow earth. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.017" end="00:39:31.217" style="s2">Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.217" end="00:39:32.717" style="s2">Humans can&#39;t fly</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.217" end="00:39:38.017" style="s2">for the territory. Fire.</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.917" end="00:40:18.617" style="s2">Wyvens, burn these iron birds <br />to ash. [screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.617" end="00:40:28.150" style="s2">Die you lowborn human. [groaning] [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.151" end="00:40:31.818" style="s2">[groaning]  </p>
<p begin="00:40:31.817" end="00:40:33.217" style="s2">It&#39;s over. Alien filth.</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.317" end="00:40:44.317" style="s2">My lord, Garak is dead, too. The Y <br />of Alleion is completely wiped out.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.319" end="00:40:58.119" style="s2">Liam, you think learning to <br />fly challenges elven authority?  </p>
<p begin="00:40:58.119" end="00:41:00.719" style="s2">My lord, what should we [music] do next?</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.319" end="00:41:07.319" style="s2">[snorts]  </p>
<p begin="00:41:07.319" end="00:41:12.319" style="s2">I&#39;ll rally the neighboring lords. Declare Yellow <br />Earth a heretical state. Cut off all their trade.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.919" end="00:41:24.719" style="s2">Without supplies, let&#39;s see how long they last. <br />Sillus has isolated us. No merchant caravan  </p>
<p begin="00:41:24.719" end="00:41:30.619" style="s2">will dare come near Yellow Earth again. A joint <br />declaration. He thinks that can starve us out.</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.519" end="00:41:36.519" style="s2">True justice cannot be torn <br />apart by a piece of paper.  </p>
<p begin="00:41:38.019" end="00:41:42.619" style="s2">But Lord, we only have three citystates. <br />How can we stand against an elven lord?</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.319" end="00:41:57.319" style="s2">From today on, our three cities will <br />formally establish the new Federal  </p>
<p begin="00:41:57.319" end="00:42:04.419" style="s2">Assembly. And this [music] is our declaration. <br />The Commoner Enlightenment Declaration. What  </p>
<p begin="00:42:04.419" end="00:42:10.019" style="s2">does this say? [music] Within the Federation, all <br />are equal. Slavery is abolished. All member towns  </p>
<p begin="00:42:10.019" end="00:42:17.119" style="s2">share the great forge [music] technology. Equal? <br />You&#39;re giving peasants the same rights as nobles.  </p>
<p begin="00:42:17.119" end="00:42:21.119" style="s2">We don&#39;t need noble privilege. We need every <br />oppressed [music] soul to become our ally.  </p>
<p begin="00:42:23.019" end="00:42:27.419" style="s2">Silus will go mad. This is a direct <br />declaration of war against their authority.  </p>
<p begin="00:42:27.919" end="00:42:31.019" style="s2">Then let him watch and see <br />who truly rules this land.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.519" end="00:42:40.419" style="s2">Miss, we&#39;ve prepared 300 copies. The <br />carrier pigeons [music] are ready.</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.219" end="00:42:48.819" style="s2">Federal Lord, I&#39;ll help you spread <br />this fire across the entire continent.</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.620" end="00:42:54.620" style="s2">[snorts]  </p>
<p begin="00:42:54.620" end="00:42:59.120" style="s2">These wretched ants dare challenge elf <br />authority. Our human slaves in the mines  </p>
<p begin="00:42:59.120" end="00:43:04.920" style="s2">are fleeing. [music] Many workshops have <br />shut down. A scrap of paper [music] trying  </p>
<p begin="00:43:04.920" end="00:43:09.120" style="s2">to cut my roots. Since they want death, <br />I&#39;ll wipe yellow earth off the map.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.020" end="00:43:16.320" style="s2">Mobilize the elite magic corps. This time <br />I [music] want yellow earth reduced to ash.  </p>
<p begin="00:43:16.920" end="00:43:20.920" style="s2">My lord, the elven mages are here. They&#39;re <br />launching a direct assault on Yellow Earth.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.420" end="00:43:32.420" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.420" end="00:43:36.420" style="s2">Wretched humans, your struggles are <br />meaningless before elfin [music] magic.  </p>
<p begin="00:43:38.620" end="00:43:41.920" style="s2">Let the air calvary strike. We can&#39;t <br />let them keep hammering [music] us.  </p>
<p begin="00:43:41.920" end="00:43:46.120" style="s2">Not yet. Sending them out now would cost us <br />valuable lives. Against mages, we use this  </p>
<p begin="00:43:48.620" end="00:43:52.520" style="s2">You think you&#39;re the only ones with trump [music] <br />cards? Let me show you what I&#39;ve been working on.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.820" end="00:44:02.920" style="s2">Arrogant elves, feel the warmth of yellow earth.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.520" end="00:44:16.520" style="s2">[music]  </p>
<p begin="00:44:16.520" end="00:44:19.320" style="s2">What weapon is this? I&#39;ve <br />never seen anything like it.  </p>
<p begin="00:44:19.820" end="00:44:23.720" style="s2">Yellow Earth&#39;s new toy. Made especially <br />[music] for arrogant mages like you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.420" end="00:44:32.520" style="s2">Fire. Send these honored <br />[music] guests on their way.</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.620" end="00:44:50.620" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.620" end="00:44:54.921" style="s2">My lord, requesting permission <br />to engage. Go leave one alive.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.922" end="00:45:09.922" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.922" end="00:45:12.922" style="s2">Stay away from me. I am a noble elf.</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.122" end="00:45:29.322" style="s2">Why does Silus [music] want <br />yellow earth so badly? Talk.  </p>
<p begin="00:45:31.521" end="00:45:34.821" style="s2">Lowborn [music] humans, your <br />existence is nothing but dust.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.722" end="00:45:44.522" style="s2">Speak or I&#39;ll throw you into the great forge <br />[music] and watch you burn. Even if you defeated  </p>
<p begin="00:45:44.521" end="00:45:49.621" style="s2">the mage corp, you cannot change your fate. My <br />patience is thin. Don&#39;t make me use [music] force.</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.521" end="00:46:02.821" style="s2">The primal relic belongs [music] to the <br />elves. You ants are nothing but sacrifices.  </p>
<p begin="00:46:04.222" end="00:46:08.022" style="s2">Primal relic. What is that? What <br />does it have to do with yellow earth?</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.021" end="00:46:22.421" style="s2">My lord, watch out. He&#39;s taken poison.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.122" end="00:46:39.622" style="s2">My lord, thousands are flocking to our <br />federation every day. Our numbers are growing.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.322" end="00:46:50.322" style="s2">My lord, Silas has allied with <br />several elven lords and raised  </p>
<p begin="00:46:50.322" end="00:46:52.422" style="s2">an army. They&#39;re marching toward us now.</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.422" end="00:47:05.923" style="s2">How many? How far out? 30,000 elite troops. Three <br />pinted encirclement. Every village [music] along  </p>
<p begin="00:47:05.923" end="00:47:10.923" style="s2">the way has been burned. 30,000? <br />They mean to erase us completely.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.323" end="00:47:18.923" style="s2">Send word. All citystate representatives [music] <br />are to assemble in the war room immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.923" end="00:47:25.623" style="s2">30 sisters.  </p>
<p begin="00:47:25.623" end="00:47:30.323" style="s2">30,000 30,000 elite elven troops. <br />What are we supposed to do?  </p>
<p begin="00:47:31.523" end="00:47:41.323" style="s2">Liam, what&#39;s the plan? Surrender. <br />Yes, sir. 30,000. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.323" end="00:47:46.423" style="s2">Surrender. Have elves ever spared <br />humans? They treat us like cattle.  </p>
<p begin="00:47:47.123" end="00:47:51.823" style="s2">Fight and we die. How can human armies <br />stand against 30,000 elven troops?</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.423" end="00:48:01.423" style="s2">Shut up and listen. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.423" end="00:48:14.123" style="s2">The right flank is elvenlike cavalry. Fast but <br />lightly armored. But their mobility is too high.  </p>
<p begin="00:48:14.123" end="00:48:18.223" style="s2">Our infantry can&#39;t catch them. And we don&#39;t have <br />enough air cavalry to match those numbers. We  </p>
<p begin="00:48:18.223" end="00:48:24.223" style="s2">don&#39;t fight them head-on. Their commander will be <br />arrogant. He&#39;ll push deep without support. We set  </p>
<p begin="00:48:24.223" end="00:48:31.023" style="s2">an ambush and crush them. [music] Even if the <br />light cavalry is lightly armored, they&#39;re not  </p>
<p begin="00:48:31.023" end="00:48:38.623" style="s2">easy to break. What are we supposed to trap them <br />with? Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ll prepare a gift for them.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.823" end="00:48:57.823" style="s2">Liam, you [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.724" end="00:49:11.224" style="s2">Ellison, deploy these traps along [music] <br />the right flank. Stop their cavalry cold.  </p>
<p begin="00:49:12.524" end="00:49:13.124" style="s2">Yes, my lord.</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.724" end="00:49:27.124" style="s2">Those lowborn humans probably soiled themselves <br />the moment they heard we were coming to take  </p>
<p begin="00:49:27.124" end="00:49:30.924" style="s2">Yellow Earth. Yellow Earth&#39;s walls are <br />just scrap metal. We&#39;ll flat them today.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.024" end="00:49:54.524" style="s2">It&#39;s an ambush. Queen, fire.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.624" end="00:50:21.224" style="s2">Take him away. Let the Lord decide his fate.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.224" end="00:50:56.024" style="s2">Kill me if you dare, you crawling <br />worms. Elves do not bow to humans.  </p>
<p begin="00:50:56.924" end="00:51:03.325" style="s2">Killing you is easy, but dead men are worthless <br />[music] to my territory. Surrender. Join the  </p>
<p begin="00:51:03.325" end="00:51:07.925" style="s2">Federation&#39;s rebuilding effort and you&#39;ll <br />live. After a trial period, [music] you can  </p>
<p begin="00:51:07.926" end="00:51:12.526" style="s2">even earn full citizenship. Are you insane? <br />You&#39;d give citizenship to your enemies?  </p>
<p begin="00:51:13.125" end="00:51:18.125" style="s2">The Federation has only laws, not <br />races. This is your only way out.</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.426" end="00:51:27.726" style="s2">I accept your terms, my lord.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.426" end="00:51:40.126" style="s2">My lord, these are high-grade elven <br />magic metals from their armor.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.426" end="00:51:57.926" style="s2">The reforged armor is even harder <br />than before. Several times over.  </p>
<p begin="00:51:57.926" end="00:52:01.126" style="s2">Issue these to the infantry. We&#39;re <br />taking the fight to the left flank.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.226" end="00:52:07.926" style="s2">My lord, the men are ready. We can <br />charge at your [music] command.  </p>
<p begin="00:52:08.526" end="00:52:12.426" style="s2">Shatter their formation. Let <br />the elves taste human steel.</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.426" end="00:52:24.126" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.125" end="00:52:35.825" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.825" end="00:52:39.825" style="s2">The black steel armor is unstoppable. Follow me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.825" end="00:52:50.475" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.475" end="00:53:01.125" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.125" end="00:53:05.127" style="s2">My lord, the enemy&#39;s armored infantry is in <br />[music] full run. Sillus&#39;s major crew will  </p>
<p begin="00:53:05.127" end="00:53:11.127" style="s2">be here soon. Ride back to Yellow Earth. <br />Now, Sillis, next it&#39;s [music] your turn.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.427" end="00:53:23.327" style="s2">Both flanking armies were destroyed. Useless.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.127" end="00:53:34.327" style="s2">They have ext [music] of them.  </p>
<p begin="00:53:35.827" end="00:53:41.227" style="s2">Foolish mortals. Today I will erase <br />[music] yellow earth from this world.</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.527" end="00:54:10.527" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.527" end="00:54:13.027" style="s2">The defense line is failing. <br />The walls are collapsing.  </p>
<p begin="00:54:13.527" end="00:54:17.227" style="s2">My lord, their firepower is too <br />heavy. Our shields are breaking.</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.227" end="00:54:29.327" style="s2">Useless struggle. A human city is nothing <br />but a sand castle before magic. And you,  </p>
<p begin="00:54:29.327" end="00:54:32.427" style="s2">Liam, I will grant you death with my own hands.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.527" end="00:54:40.727" style="s2">Warning. Highle instant death spell <br />detected. Cannot be dodged. Fatal on impact.  </p>
<p begin="00:54:41.327" end="00:54:43.527" style="s2">Damn it. What do I do now?</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.527" end="00:54:53.327" style="s2">Vanish into absolute [music] <br />darkness, you lowly insect.</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.127" end="00:55:01.927" style="s2">Liam, get out of the way.</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.727" end="00:55:10.628" style="s2">Move. Move. Damn it. for the Federation.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.828" end="00:55:31.828" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.828" end="00:55:36.928" style="s2">Ellison. Allison, look at me. <br />Look at me. Hold [music] on. I&#39;ll  </p>
<p begin="00:55:36.928" end="00:55:43.828" style="s2">find a way to save you. My lord, <br />don&#39;t don&#39;t waste your strength.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.328" end="00:56:00.428" style="s2">Lord Liam, you must protect yourself and hold <br />[music] Yellow Earth. You are humanity&#39;s future.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.528" end="00:56:10.428" style="s2">I promise. I promise you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.229" end="00:56:20.529" style="s2">Foolish mortals. This is the price <br />of [music] defying gods. Liam,  </p>
<p begin="00:56:21.028" end="00:56:23.728" style="s2">you and your yellow earth will be ground to dust.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.828" end="00:56:29.528" style="s2">Why? Why is Silus [music] so determined to take  </p>
<p begin="00:56:29.528" end="00:56:32.828" style="s2">yellow earth? The resources here <br />are barren. Nothing but mines.  </p>
<p begin="00:56:35.128" end="00:56:43.228" style="s2">The primal relic belongs to the elves. You ants <br />are nothing but sacrifices. After the city falls,  </p>
<p begin="00:56:43.229" end="00:56:50.429" style="s2">the mines beneath it are yours. I only want what <br />we agreed upon. [music] So that&#39;s it. The thing  </p>
<p begin="00:56:50.428" end="00:56:56.528" style="s2">Silus wants, the primal relic. It&#39;s been hidden <br />[music] somewhere inside yellow earth all along.</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.828" end="00:57:14.229" style="s2">Avil, hold the wall no matter what until I return.  </p>
<p begin="00:57:14.230" end="00:57:18.830" style="s2">I will as long as I breathe. Not a <br />single elf steps inside. [crying]</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.230" end="00:57:40.730" style="s2">Warning. Primal [music] relic exceeds <br />host lord rank by a significant Persian.  </p>
<p begin="00:57:40.730" end="00:57:44.130" style="s2">Contact at this stage is extremely <br />hazardous. Enough. Yellow earth is  </p>
<p begin="00:57:44.130" end="00:57:47.730" style="s2">about to fall. If you know where [music] <br />the primal relic is, guide me there now.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.330" end="00:58:17.330" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.330" end="00:58:20.230" style="s2">The Lord&#39;s Cellar. I never <br />knew there was a door here.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.530" end="00:58:34.830" style="s2">Warning. Ultra high energy <br />unknown source detected.  </p>
<p begin="00:58:34.830" end="00:58:38.530" style="s2">Identified as primal [music] <br />relic. Danger level critical.  </p>
<p begin="00:58:39.130" end="00:58:43.530" style="s2">The primal relic. This is what Silas <br />wanted [music] to destroy yellow earth for.</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.230" end="00:58:56.130" style="s2">Decryption complete. The continent&#39;s [music] magic <br />is gradually drying up. The primal relic is the  </p>
<p begin="00:58:56.130" end="00:59:01.030" style="s2">source of all magic. The sole imperishable mana <br />wellspril. [music] What is Silas trying to do with  </p>
<p begin="00:59:01.030" end="00:59:06.330" style="s2">this? Silus intends to claim the primal relic for <br />himself. To merge with it and obtain eternal mana  </p>
<p begin="00:59:06.330" end="00:59:11.331" style="s2">and immortality. The cost, stripping all other <br />races of their ability [music] to wield magic.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.631" end="00:59:18.031" style="s2">Warning. The primal relic contains <br />an immense concentration of magical  </p>
<p begin="00:59:18.031" end="00:59:22.331" style="s2">energy. The host&#39;s physical body cannot <br />directly withstand it. If I don&#39;t take it,  </p>
<p begin="00:59:22.331" end="00:59:26.031" style="s2">my people will be slaughtered. Yellow <br />Earth will become a sea of blood.</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.131" end="00:59:40.431" style="s2">Current host body durability is insufficient. <br />Forcibly consuming the primal relic carries  </p>
<p begin="00:59:40.431" end="00:59:46.231" style="s2">a 90% fatality rate. A 10% survival <br />rate. That&#39;s more than enough for me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.331" end="00:59:53.131" style="s2">Hold the wall. Don&#39;t let the <br />elven mages through. Block them.</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.131" end="01:00:07.931" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.931" end="01:00:12.631" style="s2">Warning. Host body structure is <br />collapsing. Cell nuc increasing.  </p>
<p begin="01:00:14.331" end="01:00:19.031" style="s2">I am the lord of this land. I must <br />protect my people. I cannot die here.</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.831" end="01:00:35.831" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.831" end="01:00:43.531" style="s2">Your struggle ends here. Now go join that <br />old man in hell. Liam will return and drive  </p>
<p begin="01:00:43.531" end="01:00:48.531" style="s2">you thieves out of yellow earth. Still clinging <br />to [music] that fool even at death&#39;s door. Die.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.131" end="01:01:05.731" style="s2">What&#39;s happening?</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.431" end="01:01:18.332" style="s2">No, my magic. What is this spell?</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.332" end="01:01:31.352" style="s2">Give me</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.352" end="01:02:04.832" style="s2">[music] something.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.832" end="01:02:12.032" style="s2">The pain is gone. I&#39;m healed. <br />This is fire. I can use magic.</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.432" end="01:02:33.132" style="s2">Liam, you did it. I knew you wouldn&#39;t abandon us. <br />Impossible. Humans have no magical aptitude. How  </p>
<p begin="01:02:33.132" end="01:02:39.032" style="s2">could he awaken this level of power? Did <br />he take possession of the primal relic?</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.432" end="01:02:50.132" style="s2">This can&#39;t be. You&#39;re just a human. How <br />could you possibly master the primal relic?  </p>
<p begin="01:02:51.132" end="01:02:52.232" style="s2">It&#39;s over, Silus.</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.832" end="01:02:57.032" style="s2">No, you won&#39;t kill me so easily.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.334" end="01:03:27.934" style="s2">We propose reforming the Federation <br />into the Continental United Duction.  </p>
<p begin="01:03:29.034" end="01:03:32.134" style="s2">And we ask Lord Liam to serve as its Archin.</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.034" end="01:03:36.134" style="s2">Hail the Archin.</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.234" end="01:03:42.634" style="s2">Put the crown away. I don&#39;t need that title,  </p>
<p begin="01:03:44.934" end="01:03:48.634" style="s2">my lord. Without a title, how <br />will the dice command authority?</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.734" end="01:03:58.834" style="s2">Titles don&#39;t matter. What matters <br />is that within the Federation,  </p>
<p begin="01:03:58.834" end="01:04:01.134" style="s2">no one ever has to [music] <br />bow again just to survive.</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.934" end="01:04:15.834" style="s2">Ellison&#39;s funeral was held with full [music] <br />honor. The people are cheering for you,  </p>
<p begin="01:04:15.834" end="01:04:20.034" style="s2">Ellison. I kept my promise. Yellow Earth stands.  </p>
<p begin="01:04:21.634" end="01:04:30.934" style="s2">Liam, promise me. From now on, wherever <br />you go, take me with you. I promise.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.234" end="01:04:42.634" style="s2">Warning. Continental unification main [music] <br />quest initiated. Multiple high threat territories  </p>
<p begin="01:04:42.634" end="01:04:49.434" style="s2">detected. The Magic Council, the Frost Giants, and <br />the Dragon Clans. Seems the system won&#39;t [music]  </p>
<p begin="01:04:49.434" end="01:04:54.734" style="s2">give me a break. Next, I&#39;ll plant the Federation&#39;s <br />banner on every corner of this continent.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
